#: src-en/data/hyperspace.xml.append:1909
msgid ""
"data/hyperspace.xml.append$//race[@name=\"unique_lily_avatar\"]/powerEffect[1]/tooltip"
msgstr ""
"ELDRITCH BLAST [COOLDOWN:15s]\n"
"Supercharges your cursor with chaotic eldritch energy. Your next click on a tile will summon a pinpoint beam aimed at it.\n"
"\tSys. Damage: 2; Crew damage: 45; Shield pierce: 10; Fire chance: 40%; Breach chance: 40%.\n"
"\tTemporarily induces madness on the crew it hits, disabling their active abilities.\n"
"\tCan target your own ship."

#: src-en/data/hyperspace.xml.append:1928
