#: src-en/data/hyperspace.xml.append:1929
msgid ""
"data/hyperspace.xml.append$//race[@name=\"unique_lily_avatar\"]/powerEffect[2]/tooltip"
msgstr ""
"[COOLDOWN:90s  DURATION:10s]\n"
"Supercharges your cursor with ionic energy. For the next 10 seconds, your clicks on tiles will summon a ion pinpoint beam aimed at it.\n"
"\tIon Damage: 1; Shield pierce: 10; Stun: 10 seconds.\n"
"\tCan target your own ship.\n"
"\tAlso deals 2 ion damage to your pause button, disabling your ability to pause game for the duration."

